We need administrator
privileges.

00:40:40.980 --> 00:40:42.450
Run as administrator.

00:40:42.450 --> 00:40:51.810
Run. Yes. And there we go.

00:40:51.810 --> 00:40:56.650
Let's confirm that, yes, we
want to onboard this device.

00:40:59.000 --> 00:41:02.780
And we've successfully
