00:41:38.970 --> 00:41:43.600
So we're going to go back to our
"System Settings," "Endpoints."

00:41:46.260 --> 00:41:49.380
Let's scroll down to
"Onboarding" once again.

00:41:49.380 --> 00:41:52.050
Scroll past the
onboarding strategy,

00:41:52.050 --> 00:41:55.350
section two, run
a detection test.

00:41:55.350 --> 00:42:00.210
We've got a command we can
run over here to test.

00:42:00.210 --> 00:42:03.300
Make sure that the
onboarding was successful.

00:42:03.300 --> 00:42:05.430
We'll copy that
