00:42:18.300 --> 00:42:19.620
"Execute."

00:42:19.620 --> 00:42:22.020
The prompt automatically closed.

00:42:22.020 --> 00:42:23.820
That's normal.

00:42:23.820 --> 00:42:28.050
And done. We've issued the test.

00:42:28.050 --> 00:42:29.430
And now let's see

00:42:29.430 --> 00:42:33.850
