00:42:44.510 --> 00:42:47.970
suspicious PowerShell
command line.

00:42:47.970 --> 00:42:57.820
Let's manage the incident and
mark it as a security test.

00:43:00.720 --> 00:43:03.120
"Done." "Save."

00:43:03.120 --> 00:43:06.330
So we've tested that
the device is onboarded

00:43:06.330 --> 00:43:10.240
